<title>CHILE: Banco Bhif nine months net 9.3 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco Bhif nine months net 9.3 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Bhif reported net earnings of 9.3 billion pesos for the first nine months of the year, the Superintendency of Banks and Financial Institutions.</p>
<p>Year-ago figures were not available.</p>
<p>The superintendency said Bhif reported capital and reserves of 57 billion pesos and outstanding loans of 833 billion pesos.</p>
<p>-- Santiago Newsroom 56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
